          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising military strikes and force employment in the Hormuz theatre increase market volatility and perceived project risk, causing venture and corporate investors to delay or reallocate capital away from capital‑intensive AI projects, reducing the rate of new AI investment." />
