          <attvalue for="35" value="A rise in kinetic confrontations around Hormuz triggers accelerated US/allied intelligence, cyber‑forensics funding and interagency data‑sharing to track responsible actors, directly improving intrusion detection and attribution tooling and processes relevant to the US–China tech competition." />
