          <attvalue for="35" value="Greater policy alignment and coordination among Western allies driven by the Russia–Ukraine crisis enables quicker, unified sanctions and secondary‑sanctions measures against actors involved in Hormuz disruptions, increasing economic pressure on those networks." />
