          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rapid, unilateral increases in US tariffs force allied governments into immediate defensive responses (tariff exemptions, retaliatory measures, public criticism), producing visible policy divergence and reducing short-term alignment within NATO/EU coalitions." />
