          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Frequent reciprocal trade or sanction measures provoke governments to adopt targeted export controls, screening rules and data-transfer limits focused on AI-relevant technologies as political countermeasures." />
