          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher available AI compute enables faster deployment and more capable AI-driven maritime surveillance, automatic vessel-tracking and anomaly detection systems by coalition navies and commercial operators, reducing surprise harassment and improving safe passage in the Strait of Hormuz." />
          <attvalue for="36" value="6-18 months" />
