          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher installed AI compute directly enables training and running larger, more capable offensive models (automated vulnerability discovery, malware generation and phishing automation), increasing the scale and sophistication of AI-enabled attacks." />
