          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Tighter supply of advanced chips pushes actors toward gray- and black-market procurement chains that rely on covert sea shipments and small-boat transfers in the Persian Gulf, increasing interception incidents, misidentifications and localized maritime insecurity." />
