          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Stronger constraints on advanced accelerators and semiconductors raise lead times and costs for precision munitions, loitering munitions and smart munitions production, degrading the rate at which belligerents can sustain high‑intensity strike operations." />
