          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Acute pressure on advanced chip supplies drives buyers toward alternative, third‑party or grey-market sources and shortens vetting cycles, increasing the probability that deployed hardware contains insecure or backdoored components." />
